月，发生了日食。","content_jianti_auto":"2二月，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6367,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9b606ef9-db0e-11ef-a0b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"舜","people_name_jianti_auto":"舜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9b606efc-db0e-11ef-83c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堯","people_name_jianti_auto":"尧","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9b606efd-db0e-11ef-ad41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"驩兜","people_name_jianti_auto":"驩兜","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9b606efe-db0e-11ef-acb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"共工","people_name_jianti_auto":"共工","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9b606eff-db0e-11ef-86bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"舜之佐堯也，驩兜、共工自相稱引則流放之，讒說殄行則堲之，戒比周也。好，呼到翻。治，直吏翻；下同。比，毗至翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"舜之佐尧也，驩兜、共工自相称引则流放之，谗说殄行则堲之，戒比周也。好，呼到翻。治，直吏翻；下同。比，毗至翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9b606efb-db0e-11ef-8986-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9b606f01-db0e-11ef-b2a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成王","people_name_jianti_auto":"成王","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9b606f02-db0e-11ef-a378-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔安國","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔安国","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9b606f03-db0e-11ef-b10a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"書·洛誥：周公戒成王曰：孺子其朋，孺子其朋，其往。孔安國註曰：少子愼其朋黨，少子愼其朋黨，戒其自今已往。","note_content_jianti_auto":"书·洛诰：周公戒成王曰：孺子其朋，孺子其朋，其往。孔安国注曰：少子愼其朋党，少子愼其朋党，戒其自今已往。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9b606f00-db0e-11ef-a22a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書","official_note":"尚書是中央行政机构尚书台的官员，负责处理政务和文书，此处何晏担任此职，在文中作为朋附曹爽的官员之一，反映了当时政治派系斗争。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"時尚書何晏等朋附曹爽","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b1b6690a-4092-4220-8cbe-bf7fb9884b68"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"太尉","official_note":"太尉是古代三公之一，掌管军事，此处蒋济以太尉身份上疏，劝谏曹爽不要变改法度，体现了其在朝中的高位和影响力。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"太尉蔣濟上疏曰","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"26ef1391-ae13-4469-a00b-2f8c5e2b95cc"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":196,"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"何晏，字平叔，南阳宛（今河南南阳）人，东汉末年大将军何进孙，曹操的婿養子，三国时期玄学家，魏晋玄学贵无派创始人，与王弼并称“王何”，玄学代表人物之一，在高平陵之变与曹爽等同被司马氏诛杀，卒于正始十年（249年）。何晏以俊美著稱，有“何郎粉”、“傅粉何郎”之语，代指美男子。","link_td_id":"Q10005760","link_td_number_id":98676,"people_name":"何晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"何晏","people_xingming":"何晏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9b606f06-db0e-11ef-9fcf-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"曹爽，沛国谯县（今安徽亳州）人，曹真之子，曹操侄孙、夏侯玄的表哥。官至大将军、录尚书事，明帝遗诏与司马懿共同辅政。后司马懿发动高平陵之变，将曹爽斩杀，夷三族。","link_td_id":"Q10004323","link_td_number_id":230722,"people_name":"曹爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹爽","people_xingming":"曹爽","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9b606f07-db0e-11ef-b757-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"蒋济，字子通。楚国平阿（今安徽省怀远县）人。东汉末及三国时曹魏名臣，官至太尉。","link_td_id":"Q10001317","link_td_number_id":656953,"people_name":"蔣濟","people_name_jianti_auto":"蒋济","people_xingming":"蒋济","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9b606f08-db0e-11ef-9ce9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"舜，中国上古时代的五帝之一，东夷人。亦是道教与民间信仰的地官大帝。名重华；生于姚墟，为姚姓，后居于妫水之边，后人将姚姓改为妫姓，有虞氏。冀州人，都城在蒲阪（今山西永济）。舜为四部落联盟首领，以受尧的「禅让」而称帝于天下，其国号为「有虞」。","link_td_id":"Q10000010","link_td_number_id":4332,"people_name":"大舜","people_name_jianti_auto":"大舜","people_xingming":"舜","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9b606f09-db0e-11ef-b5da-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"周公旦，姬姓，周氏，名旦，谥文，又称周文公、周公。周文王第四子、周武王之弟，西周初年政治家，封于周邑，为诸侯国鲁国之祖，创“礼乐制度”。武则天天授元年（690年）追封为“褒德王”，宋真宗大中祥符元年（1008年）追封为“文宪王”，后世多称其“元圣”。","link_td_id":"Q10000209","link_td_number_id":15573,"people_name":"周公","people_name_jianti_auto":"周公","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0a-db0e-11ef-96e3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"時尚書何晏等朋附曹爽，好變改法度。太尉蔣濟上疏曰：「昔大舜佐治，戒在比周；周公輔政，愼於其朋。夫爲國法度，惟命世大才，乃能張其綱維以垂於後，豈中下之吏所宜改易哉！終無益於治，適足傷民。宜使文武之臣，各守其職，率以清平，則和氣祥瑞可感而致也！」","content_fanyi":"当时，魏国尚书何晏等人与曹爽结为朋党，喜欢改动国家的法令制度。太尉蒋济上疏说：“从前大舜辅佐唐尧治理天下，所警戒的是结党营私；周公辅佐成王执掌政务，对朋党问题也极为审慎。大凡治国法度，只有闻名于世的杰出人才才能掌握其纲要而流传后世，哪里是才能中下的官吏可以随意更改的呢！最终无益于国家的治理，反而只会伤害百姓。应当让文武官员各自恪守职责，一律做到清正公平，那么平和之气与吉祥符瑞就会受到感应而降临了。”","content_jianti_auto":"时尚书何晏等朋附曹爽，好变改法度。太尉蒋济上疏曰：「昔大舜佐治，戒在比周；周公辅政，愼于其朋。夫为国法度，惟命世大才，乃能张其纲维以垂于后，岂中下之吏所宜改易哉！终无益于治，适足伤民。宜使文武之臣，各守其职，率以清平，则和气祥瑞可感而致也！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6368,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9b606efa-db0e-11ef-b03e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"漢獻帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"汉献帝","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0d-db0e-11ef-816c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0e-db0e-11ef-8363-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武昌","place_name_jianti_auto":"武昌","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0f-db0e-11ef-b50b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吳以漢獻帝建安二十四年都武昌，至是已二十八年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吴以汉献帝建安二十四年都武昌，至是已二十八年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0c-db0e-11ef-ada0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9b606f12-db0e-11ef-ae16-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"致，謂伐材木而致之。通者，凡吳境內悉然也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"致，谓伐材木而致之。通者，凡吴境内悉然也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9b606f11-db0e-11ef-8c4a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9b606f15-db0e-11ef-9a0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太初宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"太初宫","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9b606f16-db0e-11ef-a199-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉太康地記曰：吳有太初宮，方三百丈。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋太康地记曰：吴有太初宫，方三百丈。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"9b606f14-db0e-11ef-9525-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"以下奉上，義當助作宮室。","note_content_jianti_auto":"以下奉上，义当助作宫室。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"9b606f18-db0e-11ef-8b69-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"君主","official_name":"吳主","official_note":"吳主指三国时期吴国的君主，此处为孙权，负责发布诏令和决策国家事务，如迁移宫殿材料。","official_rank":"最高统治者","source_snippet":"吳主詔徙武昌宮材瓦繕修建業宮","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"7502ab09-e94b-47fe-b174-14f3a6a747b9"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"行政官员","official_name":"有司","official_note":"有司泛指负责具体事务的官员或部门，此处可能指工部或相关机构，负责报告宫殿状况并提出建议。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"有司奏言","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"42ff8a18-3dc4-4a43-9062-9a1629167eca"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"諸將","official_note":"諸將指吴国的将领们，此处被命令参与宫殿修建的义作，显示军事官员也承担非军事任务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"令諸將及州郡皆義作","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"e57f0d95-e1e3-40bd-9541-7860db86ee0b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"州郡","official_note":"州郡指地方行政单位，如州和郡的官员，此处被命令参与宫殿修建，反映地方行政机构在工程中的角色。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"令諸將及州郡皆義作","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"5bf9aa4c-cf0e-40d7-be2d-0bfcd64de2f5"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"禹，姒姓，夏后氏，传说名文命，后世尊称为大禹。远古时期中国神话人物，是黄帝轩辕氏八世孙，因在大禹治水中成功治理洪水之患的故事而广为人知。传说中，禹是中国历史上第一个家天下政权夏朝的开创者，定都于阳城（具体所在有多种说法）。禹在尧时被封为夏伯，故史书又称伯禹、夏禹。在道教信仰里，禹也被尊为水官大帝、水仙尊王。","link_td_id":"Q10000013","link_td_number_id":4218,"people_name":"大禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"大禹","people_xingming":"大禹","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1d-db0e-11ef-8268-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":33,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9b606f19-db0e-11ef-af5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武昌宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"武昌宫","resolved_place_entity_id":4818,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1a-db0e-11ef-a995-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建業宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"建业宫","resolved_place_entity_id":6965,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1b-db0e-11ef-807d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武昌宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"武昌宫","resolved_place_entity_id":4818,"start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1c-db0e-11ef-9c7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":33,"start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1e-db0e-11ef-afb7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武昌","place_name_jianti_auto":"武昌","resolved_place_entity_id":352,"start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"9b606f1f-db0e-11ef-812b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"太初宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"太初宫","resolved_place_entity_id":6476,"start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"9b606f20-db0e-11ef-b026-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋平吴，复为秣陵。太康三年，复分秣陵之水北置建业县，为丹...","context_before":"...江百余里，可以安大船，吾方理水军，当移据之，寻改曰建业。","source_end_index":184,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9b00dc93-a9cf-59b5-b315-7724c56c2eab","source_start_index":165,"source_text":"吴赤乌十年，缮修宫室，改作太初宫居之。"},{"context_after":"，其正殿曰神龙，中门曰公车，中门之东曰升贤，又东曰左掖，...","context_before":"○建康宫[在故台城内。《实录》：","source_end_index":35,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"64cd61ec-45ea-590e-97be-090385f4eb08","source_start_index":16,"source_text":"吴大帝迁都建业，徙武昌宫室材瓦缮太初宫"}],"path":"南直方舆纪要/一、应天府（卷二十）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"3吳主詔徙武昌宮材瓦繕修建業宮。有司奏言：「武昌宮已二十八歲，恐不堪用，宜下所在，通更伐致。」吳主曰：「大禹以卑宮爲美。今軍事未已，所在賦斂，若更通伐，妨損農桑，徙武昌材瓦，自可用也。」乃徙居南宮。三月，改作太初宮，令諸將及州郡皆義作。","content_fanyi":"吴主下诏，拆运武昌宫的砖瓦木材，用以修缮建业宫。主管官员上奏说：“武昌宫至今已有二十八年，砖木恐怕已经破旧难用；建业宫修缮所需材料，应当下达给各地，由各地普遍重新砍伐运来。”吴主说：“大禹以低矮的宫室为美，我也应当如此。如今战事还未停止，各地已经在征收赋税；如果再让各地砍伐木材，就会妨害农桑；移用武昌宫的砖瓦木材，自然仍可使用。”于是迁居南宫。三月，改建太初宫，命令各将领及州郡长官都来义务协助建造。","content_jianti_auto":"3吴主诏徙武昌宫材瓦缮修建业宫。有司奏言：「武昌宫已二十八岁，恐不堪用，宜下所在，通更伐致。」吴主曰：「大禹以卑宫为美。今军事未已，所在赋敛，若更通伐，妨损农桑，徙武昌材瓦，自可用也。」乃徙居南宫。三月，改作太初宫，令诸将及州郡皆义作。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6369,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9b606f0b-db0e-11ef-8f5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"迁太后以专权","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_9B606F21DB0E11EF8EC3A0D3651F611F_01"},{"decision_name":"称病不朝以避祸","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_9B606F21DB0E11EF8EC3A0D3651F611F_02"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":6,"chapter_name":"考证篇第六","chenzhu_chapter":"胡注长于地理及考证，今日学者无不知。书名《表微》，非微何必表也？曰：考证为史学方法之一，欲实事求是，非考证不可。彼毕生从事考证，以为尽史学之能事者固非；薄视考证以为不足道者，亦未必是也。兹特辑存数十条，以备史学之一法，固知非大义微言所在也。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":14,"chenzhu_text":"《鲒埼亭集》外编廿八，《读魏志曹爽传》云：“旧史不平之事，有二大案焉：其一为曹爽；其一为王叔文王伾。爽以曹氏宗支，有见于司马氏之难制，夺其官，思以张王室，不可谓非。而不自知驾驭奸雄之非其才也，委任何、邓，而又非其才也，遂见覆于司马氏。既覆，而司马氏百端造谤以加之，史臣从而书之，居然下流之归矣。叔文伾之事，范文正公颇昭雪之，而爽之冤，千古无言之者，呜呼！八司马当时幸而不死，皆有文章经術传于世，故後人尚有昭雪之者，何、邓实亦八司马之流，浮躁率露则有之，其心岂有他哉！身罹重典，不复邀有心人之原谅，其可伤也！”《潜研堂集》二，亦有《何晏论》，云：“陈寿之徒，以平叔与司马宣王有隙，故传记不无诬词。”二家所论，意与《胡注》同。然《胡注》所用之方法是考证，二家则评论耳。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":43,"tongjian_id":"CH06-CZ014"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"陳壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈寿","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9b606f23-db0e-11ef-b30a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曹爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹爽","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9b606f24-db0e-11ef-bb89-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"爽","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"9b606f25-db0e-11ef-86e3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9b606f26-db0e-11ef-af21-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"永寧寺","place_name_jianti_auto":"永宁寺","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9b606f27-db0e-11ef-b4cc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"銅駝街","place_name_jianti_auto":"铜驼街","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9b606f28-db0e-11ef-85c9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"前魏","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9b606f29-db0e-11ef-8aa5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"永寧殿","place_name_jianti_auto":"永宁殿","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9b606f2a-db0e-11ef-954a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"永寧宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"永宁宫","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"9b606f2b-db0e-11ef-8e88-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"9b606f2c-db0e-11ef-a6e7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"永寧宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"永宁宫","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"9b606f2d-db0e-11ef-b59c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"9b606f2e-db0e-11ef-9443-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"據後魏起永寧寺於銅駝街西，意卽前魏永寧殿故處也。又據陳壽志，太后稱永寧宮，非徙也。意者晉諸臣欲增曹爽之惡，以遷字加之耳。晉書·五行志曰：爽遷太后於永寧宮，太后與帝相泣而別。蓋亦承晉諸臣所記也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"据后魏起永宁寺于铜驼街西，意即前魏永宁殿故处也。又据陈寿志，太后称永宁宫，非徙也。意者晋诸臣欲增曹爽之恶，以迁字加之耳。晋书·五行志曰：爽迁太后于永宁宫，太后与帝相泣而别。盖亦承晋诸臣所记也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9b606f22-db0e-11ef-a16b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_setup","source_end_index":10,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"爲司馬懿誅曹爽等張本","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9b705ceb-db0e-11ef-ae45-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"司馬懿","people_name_jianti_auto":"司马懿","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9b606f33-db0e-11ef-bd88-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曹爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹爽","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9b606f34-db0e-11ef-b007-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲司馬懿誅曹爽等張本。與，讀曰預。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为司马懿诛曹爽等张本。与，读曰预。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"9b606f32-db0e-11ef-a461-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"大將軍","official_note":"大將軍是漢魏時期最高軍事長官，掌管全國軍隊，此處指曹爽，他在此段中專擅朝政，顯示其權力極大。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"大將軍爽用何晏、鄧颺、丁謐之謀","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"59490e6f-a961-4b9b-8375-4a43a9d267e0"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中樞近臣","official_name":"太傅","official_note":"太傅是皇帝的老師或輔政大臣，地位尊崇，此處指司馬懿，他與曹爽有矛盾，反映當時政治鬥爭。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"太傅懿不能禁，與爽有隙","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"32b72fe9-7194-4ccc-ae5a-cd7921f8a41e"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"曹爽，沛国谯县（今安徽亳州）人，曹真之子，曹操侄孙、夏侯玄的表哥。官至大将军、录尚书事，明帝遗诏与司马懿共同辅政。后司马懿发动高平陵之变，将曹爽斩杀，夷三族。","link_td_id":"Q10004323","link_td_number_id":230722,"people_name":"爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"爽","people_xingming":"曹爽","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9b606f35-db0e-11ef-9d8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":196,"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"何晏，字平叔，南阳宛（今河南南阳）人，东汉末年大将军何进孙，曹操的婿養子，三国时期玄学家，魏晋玄学贵无派创始人，与王弼并称“王何”，玄学代表人物之一，在高平陵之变与曹爽等同被司马氏诛杀，卒于正始十年（249年）。何晏以俊美著稱，有“何郎粉”、“傅粉何郎”之语，代指美男子。","link_td_id":"Q10005760","link_td_number_id":98676,"people_name":"何晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"何晏","people_xingming":"何晏","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9b606f36-db0e-11ef-8f22-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"邓飏，字玄茂，南阳新野人。是东汉太傅邓禹的后代。与夏侯玄、诸葛诞和田畴并称为“四聪”。三国时曹魏大将军曹爽的党羽。","link_td_id":"Q10010378","link_td_number_id":1039275,"people_name":"鄧颺","people_name_jianti_auto":"邓飏","people_xingming":"邓飏","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9b606f37-db0e-11ef-8bf0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"丁谧，字彦靖，沛国人。东汉末典军校尉丁斐之子，三国时曹魏官员，大将军曹爽的党羽。","link_td_id":"Q10010375","link_td_number_id":1039443,"people_name":"丁謐","people_name_jianti_auto":"丁谧","people_xingming":"丁谧","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9b606f38-db0e-11ef-a020-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":179,"link_death_year":251,"link_td_description":"司马懿，字仲达，河内郡温县（今河南省焦作市温县）人，三国时期曹魏太傅、政治家、军事家，亦是日后西晋的奠基人。","link_td_id":"Q10000082","link_td_number_id":49432,"people_name":"懿","people_name_jianti_auto":"懿","people_xingming":"司马懿","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"9b606f3a-db0e-11ef-8e9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":249,"link_td_description":"曹爽，沛国谯县（今安徽亳州）人，曹真之子，曹操侄孙、夏侯玄的表哥。官至大将军、录尚书事，明帝遗诏与司马懿共同辅政。后司马懿发动高平陵之变，将曹爽斩杀，夷三族。","link_td_id":"Q10004323","link_td_number_id":230722,"people_name":"爽","people_name_jianti_auto":"爽","people_xingming":"曹爽","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9b606f3b-db0e-11ef-a7b7-a0d3651f611f"},{"l